{
  "comment": "Every hosted connector declared in examples/*/connectors.yaml on next before ConnectorSpec gained readiness_path and resources, with the sha256 of the canonical JSON (sort_keys, compact separators) of plugin_format.connector_render.render for it. Two synthetic declarations (names starting `synthetic/`) cover the optional fields no example uses. A build-form connector is recorded with the placeholder image registry.example/<name>:0, the image its lock would resolve. test_connector_render.py renders each recorded declaration and compares the digest, so a render change that moves an existing bundle's objects fails there. Regenerate only for a deliberate render change, never to make an unrelated change pass.",
